The clean rerun has passed construction/verification, corruption diagnostics, the JSON round-trip, and the 200,000 structure-aware guesses with no hit. It is currently finishing the exact baseline and eight-seed adversary panel; no cached result is being reused for the gate report.
diff --git a/gen_0911_0801.py b/gen_0911_0801.py
