23:The no-tool gap is between that 81,920-operation scan and a verified 255-operation route. Toggling the high bit on domain labels congruent to 1, 2, 4, or 7 modulo 8 makes every displayed permutation affine modulo `q`. Two table entries then determine each slope and intercept, and three affine maps can be composed symbolically. A solver must discover that coordinate system from the bare extensional tables; the structural hint names it explicitly.
