codex
The quota is no longer failing immediately: the first oracle request is still in progress. The loop begins at `easy` by design and will escalate through `medium`, `hard`, then the fixed-answer-length decoy axis if any model returns a valid witness.
diff --git a/gen_0911_0801.py b/gen_0911_0801.py
index 7102ed53e530cd1eddd2048b24bf503130ecc4a3..77ef96c0d3c42bf904b3add9e92369f63404e242
--- a/gen_0911_0801.py
