codex
Both G9 scratch runs hit the same 403 limit on every redraw, yielding 0 valid attempts per arm. The files remain useful audit evidence of an external failure, but they cannot support a hardened verdict. I’m finalizing the locally verified artifacts and README with that distinction explicit; I will not fabricate the missing oracle result or mislabel this as a mathematical rejection.
