codex
I found one audit-quality issue in G8: the first self-test exercised all relabellings only as one composite transform. The contract asks for each transform individually and in composition. I’m tightening that test to 100 checks—four individual relabellings plus their composition over 20 seeds—without changing the generator or certificate.
apply patch
patch: completed
